Our match finishes.
The four of us get very tired.
We come to the side of the court.
We sit and drink water.
Amit says, "Maya, you play very well."
I smile and say, "Thank you!"
"I like playing badminton a lot."
Neha asks, "Can you play with us every week?"
Sanjay also says, "Yes, we come here every Thursday evening."
"Can you come every Thursday?"
I am very happy.
I say, "Yes, absolutely."
"I can come every Thursday evening at half past five."
Amit says, "Great!"
"Now our team is complete."
We all laugh and drink a little more water.
I like talking with these people.
I like making new friends in Mumbai a lot.
